    {
      "displayText": "Bonjour ! Je suis un spécialiste de la restauration\nde fossiles.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006F006E006A006F00750072002000210020004A00650020007300750069007300200075006E00200073007000E9006300690061006C00690073007400650020006400650020006C006100200072006500730074006100750072006100740069006F006E000A0064006500200066006F007300730069006C00650073002E00100002011401410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu connais la boutique « <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Le Joyau de Kalos<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> » ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’ai vu qu’ils y vendaient deux variétés de fossiles\nqui m’intéressent...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 136
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il s’agit du Fossile Mâchoire et du Fossile\nNageoire.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLe problème, c’est que j’ai un mal fou\nà choisir lequel acheter !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Est-ce que tu veux bien choisir pour moi ?\nAchète celui qui te plaît !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous avez reçu 20 000 <U+E300> de la part de Vestigo !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 1,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006100760065007A00200072006500E7007500200032003000200030003000300020E3000020006400650020006C0061002000700061007200740020006400650020005600650073007400690067006F002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu peux aller au Joyau de Kalos et acheter soit\nun <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Fossile Mâchoire<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>, soit un <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Fossile Nageoire<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLa boutique se trouve sur l’Avenue Floréal.\nRapporte-le-moi quand ce sera fait !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 16,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 200
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
